// Carried items that are not equipment: adventuring gear, consumables,
// worn magic items and alchemical items.

// A curated subset of the alchemical item catalog (Player Core 2, alchemical bombs/elixirs/
// mutagens/poisons/tools) for the Alchemist's formula book. `level` and `damage` are the item's
// lowest (base) craftable tier. Items with more than one named tier (Lesser/Moderate/Greater/Major,
// or Elixir of Life's Minor/Lesser/Moderate/Greater/Major/True) also carry a `tiers` array so the
